# 行尾策略：源文件一律 LF，Windows 脚本保持 CRLF。
# 关键：android/gradlew 和 server/run.sh 是 shell 脚本，被转成 CRLF 后
# Linux/CI 上会报 "bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M"，所以必须锁死 LF。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.p12 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
